This project is operated by a Public Benefit Corporation (חל"צ) for Ontological Science.
The goal: Creation of an AI infrastructure based on absolute truth (Standard 441).
According to the rule "Buy the truth and sell it not" (אמת קנה ואל תמכור),
the information and code in this repository are not for sale,
cannot be commercialized, and are intended to serve the public only.

